    width8: '1'
    width9: '1'
    width10: '1'
    affinity: ''
    alias: ''
    autoscale: 'False'
    average: '1.0'
    comment: "THE SPECTRUM \u2014 128 bins off chain A's tail, on a real FREQUENCY\
      \ axis. x runs from -samp_rate/2 = -16000 Hz in steps of bin_hz = samp_rate/n_fft\
      \ = 250 Hz, so point i is (i - 64)*250 Hz. The demo tones (natural bins 9 and\
      \ 37) are the lines at +2250 Hz and +9250 Hz; every other bin sits on the -90\
      \ dBFS floor."
